@bnoordhuis We reached the consensus that it's not a bug, so the `node inspect` REPL should have the same behavior.

Current:
```
% node
> { a: 1 }
{ a: 1 }

% node inspect app.js
debug> { a: 1 }
1
```

Expected:
```
% node
> { a: 1 }
{ a: 1 }

% node inspect app.js
debug> { a: 1 }
{ a: 1 }
```
